      "punte": [
        "fix: [taal] in 'Gedigte wat iemand, soos 'n leier, se dade en eienskappe prys.': The inserted 'soos 'n leier' splits the possessive 'iemand ... se', which is clumsy to read.",
        "fix: [taal] in 'oor baie jare aan': 'oor baie jare' can be read as 'in many years from now' (as in 'oor twee jaar'), so the time span is ambiguous.",
        "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): 'Erfenis wat jy nie kan vashou nie': The block heading says 'vashou' while the decided definition of nie-tasbare erfenis deliberately uses 'aanraak' (chosen over 'vashou' to mirror tasbare erfenis); a learner sees two verbs for one idea. Whether the heading should follow the definition is a writer's choice, so it is flagged, not changed."
